> Using Optionals

```catala-metadata
#[test]
#[testcase.testui]
#[testcase.test_description = ""]
#[testcase.test_title = "GUI owned"]
declaration scope Gui_test:
  output calc scope Optionals.Grant
```

```catala
scope Gui_test:
  definition calc.base equals $100.00
  definition calc.bonus equals Absent
  assertion (calc.total = $100.00)
```

```catala-metadata
#[test]
declaration scope Hand_written:
  output calc scope Optionals.Grant
```

```catala
scope Hand_written:
  definition calc.base equals $250.00
  definition calc.bonus equals Present content $10.00
  assertion (calc.total > $0.00)
  assertion (calc.total = $250.00)
```
